1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,300
It's two hundred and twelve steps. You
count every one. By step ninety,
you're wheezing.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:11,333
Step one hundred and forty. Inhaler.
Slow breath. Hold. Step one hundred
and forty-one.

3
00:00:12,033 --> 00:00:17,767
From the top, the world outside is
black. Inside, eleven thousand windows
go dark, one by one.

4
00:00:18,467 --> 00:00:23,633
Rule ten. Lights out at ten. Only the
gate lamp burns all night. Nobody
knows why.

5
00:00:24,333 --> 00:00:27,400
Then the tower speaker crackles. A
voice, low and tired.

6
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:31,300
I know that wheeze. I've known that
wheeze since I was nine years old.

7
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,933
No. That's not possible.

8
00:00:34,633 --> 00:00:40,500
A man in a long coat steps out of the
shadow. Gray in his hair. A Night
Warden armband on his sleeve.

9
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:44,967
You're late. You said you'd find a
light. It took you twenty years, you
idiot.

10
00:00:45,667 --> 00:00:46,200
Sam?

11
00:00:48,067 --> 00:00:52,567
You don't say anything else. You just
hold on. Both of you. Like it's the
first day.
